OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist dies and passenger
OL,4,Ainjured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorcyclist died and his passenger
OL,7,Fsuffered serious injuries in a crash in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FPolice said a red Honda CB1000 left
OL,11,FWalcote Road in South Kilworth at about
OL,12,F15:00 BST on Monday.
OL,14,FThe rider - a man in his 60s - died at
OL,15,Fthe scene and the pillion passenger was
OL,16,Ftaken to hospital.
OL,18,FOfficers have appealed for witnesses
OL,19,Fand dashcam footage.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
